			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW&#8217;s Dustin Rhodes announces the passing of his grandson Rowan</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398337-aews-dustin-rhodes-announces-the-passing-of-his-grandson/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398337-aews-dustin-rhodes-announces-the-passing-of-his-grandson/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:22:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dustin Rhodes]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[grandson]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[passing]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398337</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Wrestleview is sad to report that AEW&#8217;s Dustin Rhodes has announced the passing of his grandson Rowan. Dustin&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398337-aews-dustin-rhodes-announces-the-passing-of-his-grandson/">AEW&#8217;s Dustin Rhodes announces the passing of his grandson Rowan</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Wrestleview is sad to report that AEW&#8217;s Dustin Rhodes has announced the passing of his grandson Rowan. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Dustin posted to X asking everyone to pray for his daughter Dakota and her husband Bleau. No cause of death was provided. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="767" height="271" src="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-11.png" alt="" class="wp-image-398339" srcset="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-11.png 767w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-11-600x212.png 600w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-11-379x134.png 379w, https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-11-550x194.png 550w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 767px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Dakota is the daughter of Dustin and his first wife Terri Runnels.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Wrestleview sends its condolences to Dustin, Terri, Dakota, her husband Bleau and the entire Runnels family during this very sad time. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398337-aews-dustin-rhodes-announces-the-passing-of-his-grandson/">AEW&#8217;s Dustin Rhodes announces the passing of his grandson Rowan</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
