			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Japanese wrestling legend Genichiro Tenryu in hospital</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/japan-news/398338-japanese-wrestling-legend-genichiro-tenryu-in-hospital/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/japan-news/398338-japanese-wrestling-legend-genichiro-tenryu-in-hospital/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:21:57 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Japan News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Genichiro Tenryu]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[hospital]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398338</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Genichiro Tenryu&#8217;s daughter Ayana Shimada announced on Tenryu Project&#8217;s social media that the Japanese wrestling legend has been&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/japan-news/398338-japanese-wrestling-legend-genichiro-tenryu-in-hospital/">Japanese wrestling legend Genichiro Tenryu in hospital</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Genichiro Tenryu&#8217;s daughter Ayana Shimada announced on Tenryu Project&#8217;s social media that the Japanese wrestling legend has been hospitalized due to heart failure.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The provided statement (with translation courtesy of <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/other-wrestling/japanese-wrestling-legend-genichiro-tenryu-hospitalized/">F4WOnline</a>) notes that Tenryu has had a heart condition for some time, and is currently receiving treatment.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Due to the hospital stay, the Wrestling Observer Hall of Famer will be unavailable for a scheduled appearance this weekend, but there is hope that a December 6 talk show appearance will proceed.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During his career, Tenryu was a top star throughout Japan and crossed over into the United States with appearances such as WrestleMania VII and two Royal Rumble matches.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Wrestleview wishes all the best to Genichiro Tenryu in his recovery.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="ja" dir="ltr">いつも天龍源一郎を応援してくださり、誠にありがとうございます。<br><br>突然のお知らせとなりますが、 <br>天龍源一郎は現在、入院して治療を受けております。<br><br>現在の様子と今後の出演予定につきましては、画像のお知らせをご覧ください。… <a href="https://t.co/ynAM8u2O2y">pic.twitter.com/ynAM8u2O2y</a></p>&mdash; 天龍プロジェクト (@tenproofficial) <a href="https://x.com/tenproofficial/status/2125434180310102187?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 25, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/japan-news/398338-japanese-wrestling-legend-genichiro-tenryu-in-hospital/">Japanese wrestling legend Genichiro Tenryu in hospital</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
