		<item>
		<title>WWE SmackDown viewership up, key demo drops slightly</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398310-wwe-smackdown-viewership-up-key-demo-drops-slightly/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398310-wwe-smackdown-viewership-up-key-demo-drops-slightly/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:08:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ratings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Smackdown]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[USA Network]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398310</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Last Friday&#8217;s WWE SmackDown on the USA Network, came in with 1.242 million viewers and a 0.26 rating&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398310-wwe-smackdown-viewership-up-key-demo-drops-slightly/">WWE SmackDown viewership up, key demo drops slightly</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Last Friday&#8217;s WWE SmackDown on the USA Network, came in with 1.242 million viewers and a 0.26 rating in the key 18-49 demographic.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The previous week&#8217;s show had 1.169 million viewers and 0.27 rating.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SmackDown, had an estimated 4,711 fans in attendance at the Ford Center in Evansville, Indiana. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/wwe-smackdown-nov-20-on-usa-network-1242000-viewers-0-26-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398310-wwe-smackdown-viewership-up-key-demo-drops-slightly/">WWE SmackDown viewership up, key demo drops slightly</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398310-wwe-smackdown-viewership-up-key-demo-drops-slightly/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW Collision viewership and key demo down</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398306-aew-collision-viewership-and-key-demo-down/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398306-aew-collision-viewership-and-key-demo-down/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:01:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Collision]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ratings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNT]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398306</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Last Saturday&#8217;s live episode of AEW Collision on TNT came in with 434,000 viewers and a 0.08 rating&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398306-aew-collision-viewership-and-key-demo-down/">AEW Collision viewership and key demo down</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Last Saturday&#8217;s live episode of AEW Collision on TNT came in with 434,000 viewers and a 0.08 rating in the key 18-49 demographic.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These numbers are down from the previous week&#8217;s episode, which on Wednesday, November 11 at 10:00 pm as part of the 3-hour block of AEW programming on TBS that was the go-home show for Full Gear. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The special November 11 one-hour episode drew 500,000 viewers and a 0.12 rating.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Collision for the November 21 episode, took place for the first time from the Resch Center is Green Bay, Wisconsin with an estimated 3,030 fans in attendance. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/aew-collision-nov-21-on-tnt-434000-viewers-0-08-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>



